{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在家宴客時，若想端出一道令人食慾大增的精緻大菜，不妨參考《在家宴客60道菜》中由許美德師傅示範的「龍鬚炸金蠔」。只要掌握火候與提鮮的秘技，在家也能輕鬆重現大廚水準。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"a059242c-6694-49df-a123-4a6bc16c2f1c.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/08/20261Wrl8ycWHt1787649833.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"a059242c-6694-49df-a123-4a6bc16c2f1c.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></h3><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\"><strong>龍鬚炸金蠔食譜｜食材 </strong></span></p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">28 頭金蠔 6 隻 </span></p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">蝦膠 4 兩 </span></p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">龍鬚絲 1 扎 </span></p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !i